WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.369 --> 00:00:21.593
week sped by, and before Iris knew it, the last week of camp had arrived.

2
00:00:22.273 --> 00:00:27.377
Iris' tennis game had improved a bit more, giving her some new confidence.

3
00:00:28.438 --> 00:00:33.825
When she and Grace gathered the other girls together for a pep talk, they all agreed they were

4
00:00:33.865 --> 00:00:37.527
prepared to do whatever it took to crush the boys.

5
00:00:38.487 --> 00:00:41.949
Two of the more experienced tennis players looked worried.

6
00:00:41.969 --> 00:00:48.293
"I've been losing against Akira since junior camp," Natalie said, arms crossed.

7
00:00:48.313 --> 00:00:50.494
"I'm not sure I can beat him."

8
00:00:50.514 --> 00:00:54.877
"Same with me with Alex," Kaylee grumbled.

9
00:00:54.897 --> 00:00:57.038
"He's better than I am."

10
00:00:57.058 --> 00:01:02.653
"Well, I sure don't want to lose to my brother," Iris said firmly.

11
00:01:02.673 --> 00:01:05.616
"We've got to find a way to beat the boys."

12
00:01:05.636 --> 00:01:11.921
"Don't worry, girls," Grace said, waggling her eyebrows at them.

13
00:01:11.941 --> 00:01:16.886
"I have a strategy—we'll focus on our secret weapons."

14
00:01:18.107 --> 00:01:19.328
"Secret weapons?"

15
00:01:20.048 --> 00:01:20.929
Iris blinked.

16
00:01:20.949 --> 00:01:23.491
"Yes." Grace smiled.

17
00:01:23.511 --> 00:01:25.713
"You're one of them, Iris.

18
00:01:26.414 --> 00:01:28.516
You, Anna, and Risa."

19
00:01:29.668 --> 00:01:32.471
Iris exchanged glances with Anna and Risa.

20
00:01:33.191 --> 00:01:34.732
They looked unsure too.

21
00:01:34.752 --> 00:01:36.594
"What are you talking about?"

22
00:01:37.094 --> 00:01:37.895
Kaylee asked.

23
00:01:38.816 --> 00:01:42.439
Grace gestured to herself, along with Kaylee and Natalie.

24
00:01:42.459 --> 00:01:47.743
"Well, everyone's going to expect that the three of us are pretty good, right?"

25
00:01:48.744 --> 00:01:50.966
Kaylee and Natalie slowly nodded.

26
00:01:51.586 --> 00:01:55.289
Like Grace, they'd been attending tennis camp for a few years.

27
00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:59.825
Then Grace pointed to Iris, Anna, and Risa.

28
00:01:59.845 --> 00:02:03.567
"And no one will expect much from these three, right?"

29
00:02:04.888 --> 00:02:06.488
Iris' cheeks burned.

30
00:02:06.508 --> 00:02:09.390
"Hey," she said indignantly.

31
00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:12.252
"No offense," Grace said quickly.

32
00:02:12.272 --> 00:02:13.872
"It's just a fact."

33
00:02:13.892 --> 00:02:17.114
"So how does that make us secret weapons?"

34
00:02:17.775 --> 00:02:18.575
Risa asked.

35
00:02:19.195 --> 00:02:20.656
Grace's face lit up.

36
00:02:21.617 --> 00:02:24.858
"We are going to train you hard for the next three days.

37
00:02:25.379 --> 00:02:30.413
And we'll make sure each of you is ready, and that you have some tricks up your sleeve."

38
00:02:31.694 --> 00:02:33.475
"Tricks?" Iris said.

39
00:02:33.495 --> 00:02:35.616
"Yes," Grace said.

40
00:02:35.636 --> 00:02:38.558
"Who wants to learn one right now?"

41
00:02:38.578 --> 00:02:40.159
"I do!"

42
00:02:40.979 --> 00:02:43.881
Iris shouted even louder than the younger kids.

43
00:02:44.601 --> 00:02:48.203
And on the court next to theirs, Javier whipped his head around.

44
00:02:48.223 --> 00:02:50.864
"Shh," Grace said.

45
00:02:50.884 --> 00:02:53.666
"Secret weapon, remember?"

46
00:02:53.686 --> 00:02:57.108
"Sorry!" Iris pressed her lips together.

47
00:02:58.176 --> 00:02:59.616
"I'll whisper from now on."

48
00:03:00.317 --> 00:03:02.817
Still, she couldn't hold back a smile.

49
00:03:03.397 --> 00:03:05.818
The final matches were going to be great!

50
00:03:07.319 --> 00:03:13.220
The next afternoon at lunch, Jae stopped by the table where Iris was sitting with Grace and the

51
00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:14.280
other younger girls.

52
00:03:18.502 --> 00:03:21.122
Iris, you've really improved your game!"

53
00:03:21.922 --> 00:03:23.743
Jae smiled widely at her.

54
00:03:23.763 --> 00:03:25.803
"I've been watching you play."

55
00:03:26.744 --> 00:03:27.444
He had?

56
00:03:28.344 --> 00:03:29.625
Iris grinned back.

57
00:03:29.645 --> 00:03:33.267
"Thanks. Grace has been helping me a lot."

58
00:03:34.328 --> 00:03:37.529
"Really?" He wrinkled his brow in surprise.

59
00:03:37.549 --> 00:03:40.631
"I'm sure you don't need help from her anymore.

60
00:03:41.512 --> 00:03:44.093
Maybe you can ask about coming back to the other group."

61
00:03:44.754 --> 00:03:48.916
He leaned in closer to Iris and bobbed his head toward the other table.

62
00:03:50.877 --> 00:03:52.178
"My group.

63
00:03:52.958 --> 00:03:55.320
You know, with kids our own age.

64
00:03:56.116 --> 00:04:00.278
Maybe you and I would even end up as doubles partners for the final matches."

65
00:04:01.898 --> 00:04:03.859
Iris sat up straighter in her seat.

66
00:04:04.479 --> 00:04:07.221
Jae was asking her to join his group!

67
00:04:07.801 --> 00:04:11.242
And it sounded like he actually wanted to be her partner!

68
00:04:11.262 --> 00:04:17.765
A smile fluttered across her face as she pictured the two of them playing together on the same

69
00:04:17.845 --> 00:04:20.306
side of the net while everyone watched.

70
00:04:21.266 --> 00:04:24.207
Then Iris snapped out of her pleasant daydream.

71
00:04:24.788 --> 00:04:31.688
Nearby, Javier had his head cocked to one side, as if he was straining to hear her conversation

72
00:04:31.728 --> 00:04:32.349
with Jae.

73
00:04:33.549 --> 00:04:36.672
And Javier wasn't the only one who seemed concerned.

74
00:04:37.272 --> 00:04:40.935
Grace had gone pale and silent over her turkey sandwich.

75
00:04:40.955 --> 00:04:44.817
"Um Iris bit her lip.

76
00:04:45.538 --> 00:04:46.338
"Thanks, Jae.

77
00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:48.600
It's probably not up to me, right?

78
00:04:49.721 --> 00:04:51.142
It's the counselors' decision.

79
00:04:51.682 --> 00:04:52.683
But I'll think it over."

80
00:04:52.703 --> 00:04:58.286
"Well, if it were me, I'd rather be with kids my own age."

81
00:04:59.046 --> 00:04:59.907
Jae shrugged.

82
00:04:59.927 --> 00:05:02.408
"But let me know what you decide."

83
00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:09.012
Without a backward glance, he headed over to Zoe's table.

84
00:05:09.772 --> 00:05:13.654
Iris saw Javier glare at her before turning back to his lunch.

85
00:05:13.674 --> 00:05:16.236
"What is he so mad about?"

86
00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:17.276
she thought.

87
00:05:17.837 --> 00:05:19.177
Grace let out a breath.

88
00:05:20.178 --> 00:05:23.720
"For a minute there I thought we were going to lose you."

89
00:05:24.616 --> 00:05:28.299
"You can't get rid of me that easily," Iris joked.

90
00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.821
Still, inside she was squirming.

91
00:05:32.502 --> 00:05:34.343
Jae had such a cute smile.

92
00:05:35.564 --> 00:05:40.007
And it would be fun to play doubles with him, if she didn't embarrass herself.

93
00:05:40.648 --> 00:05:45.071
If she said no to him, he'd go back to ignoring her all the time.

94
00:05:46.632 --> 00:05:53.369
Over the next couple of days, Iris tried to make up her mind as Grace, Kaylee, and Natalie

95
00:05:53.489 --> 00:05:56.411
showed Iris and the others everything they knew.

96
00:05:57.552 --> 00:06:02.535
Iris learned how to aim the ball to a specific area on the court and how to keep

97
00:06:02.575 --> 00:06:03.216
it in bounds.

98
00:06:05.758 --> 00:06:11.842
Best of all, Grace showed the beginners how to fake out their opponents by facing their bodies one

99
00:06:11.902 --> 00:06:14.304
way and then moving them in another.

100
00:06:16.845 --> 00:06:20.448
That made it hard for an opponent to predict where the ball would land.

101
00:06:21.484 --> 00:06:22.905
Iris studied the move.

102
00:06:23.725 --> 00:06:27.707
It wasn't so different from the soccer move that Papa had taught her.

103
00:06:28.327 --> 00:06:29.467
Iris gave it a try.

104
00:06:31.048 --> 00:06:33.749
Bam! "Wow!"

105
00:06:34.329 --> 00:06:35.610
Grace's face lit up.

106
00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:36.790
"That's it!

107
00:06:37.391 --> 00:06:39.011
You're a natural at that, Iris."

108
00:06:39.692 --> 00:06:42.853
"You're a natural at coaching, Grace," Iris told her.

109
00:06:43.933 --> 00:06:44.774
And it was true.

110
00:06:45.394 --> 00:06:49.836
Which was why Iris forced herself to walk over to Jae after lunch.

111
00:06:52.616 --> 00:06:56.839
"I'm going to stick with the younger kids' group," she said nervously.

112
00:06:56.859 --> 00:06:59.921
"Huh?" He looked surprised.

113
00:06:59.941 --> 00:07:02.142
"Are you sure about that?"

114
00:07:02.843 --> 00:07:05.545
Iris blinked and then nodded slowly.

115
00:07:06.385 --> 00:07:09.627
On her soccer teams, she had always been a good teammate.

116
00:07:10.228 --> 00:07:11.969
And that's what she was being now.

117
00:07:11.989 --> 00:07:14.210
"Thanks, but I'm sure."

118
00:07:14.751 --> 00:07:15.671
Jae shrugged.

119
00:07:15.691 --> 00:07:17.853
"Whatever," he said.

120
00:07:17.873 --> 00:07:19.434
"See you around."

121
00:07:20.875 --> 00:07:28.481
Back on the courts later, Iris heard Ben shouting instructions to Javier on how to improve his swing.

122
00:07:32.004 --> 00:07:36.928
Each time Javier's racket made contact with the ball, his face brightened.

123
00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:45.374
Even if the ball went out of bounds or crashed into the net, he seemed to be having

124
00:07:45.455 --> 00:07:53.829
fun. As though he was actually enjoying being outdoors and playing with real friends instead of imaginary ones

125
00:07:53.969 --> 00:07:54.769
in the computer.

126
00:07:56.149 --> 00:08:00.651
But each time Javier met Iris' gaze, he scowled at her.

127
00:08:01.591 --> 00:08:06.712
They'd barely spoken all week long, and this was beginning to bother Iris.

128
00:08:07.853 --> 00:08:11.894
On top of that, she could sense that something was bugging her twin.

129
00:08:13.054 --> 00:08:18.676
Still, with his unfriendly attitude, she wasn't about to ask him what was wrong.

130
00:08:19.548 --> 00:08:25.632
Only one thing between them seemed clear: there was no way she was going to let him beat

131
00:08:25.672 --> 00:08:31.115
her. Iris gripped her racket and turned her attention back to practice.

132
00:08:31.896 --> 00:08:33.897
She was in it to win it!
